UPDATE companies SET description='Blue Ridge Graphics is a family-owned and operated business in Charlottesville, Virginia. Founded in 1979 by John and Ruth Kulick, the company began with a passion for t-shirt printing, starting with a print for Organic Gardening Magazine. In 2010 and 2011, the next generation, Will and Jackson, joined full-time, continuing the legacy.

The company specializes in screen printing, embroidery, promotional products, and web stores. Screen printing services include standard inks (plastisol, water-based), special effects (algae ink, foil, metallic, glow-in-the-dark), simulated process, and transfers. Embroidery was added in 2021. They also offer corporate awards, trade show booths, and signage. The shop operates with low minimums of 24 pieces and a standard two-week turnaround after proof approval.

Blue Ridge Graphics serves a diverse clientele across the Mid-Atlantic region, including university athletics, student groups, retailers, local businesses, national events, and international musicians. They have serviced the Charlottesville area and beyond for over 40 years.

The company differentiates itself through its Sustainable Green Printing Partnership (SGP) certification, earned in 2023, reflecting a commitment to environmentally friendly practices such as water-based and algae-based inks. They emphasize personal service, with a team of experts and artists working directly with customers.', certifications=ARRAY['Sustainable Green Printing Partnership (SGP)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Screen printing (plastisol, water-based inks)", "Special effects screen printing (algae ink, foil, metallic, glow-in-the-dark)", "Simulated process printing", "Heat transfer printing", "Embroidery", "Promotional products sourcing", "Web store management", "Corporate awards production", "Trade show booth production", "Signage production", "Graphic design and art assistance", "PMS color matching"], "industries": ["University athletics", "Student groups", "Retail", "Local businesses", "National events", "International musicians", "Corporate"], "materials": ["Apparel (t-shirts, performance wear, sweatshirts, accessories)", "Plastisol ink", "Water-based ink", "Algae-based ink", "Foil", "Metallic ink", "Glow-in-the-dark ink"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "2 weeks standard after proof approval; rush orders available", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Only commercial apparel screen printer in the U.S. with SGP certification", "Family-owned and operated since 1979", "Low minimums: 24 pieces", "Standard two-week turnaround after proof approval", "Uses water-based and algae-based inks"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1979 by John and Ruth Kulick -> /about", "Family-owned and operated -> /about", "Located in Charlottesville, Virginia -> /about, db", "Screen printing, embroidery, promotional products, web stores -> /about, /services, /", "SGP certification in 2023 -> /about", "Minimum order 24 pieces -> /services, /", "Standard turnaround 2 weeks after proof approval -> /services", "Uses water-based and algae inks -> /about, /services", "Cl