UPDATE companies SET description='Blue Sky Smart Solutions, headquartered in Wichita, Kansas, traces its roots to 1996 when it began as Blue Sky Satellite Services in Kansas City. The family-owned company started with satellite installations and has since grown into a regional provider of smart home technology and installation services across the Midwest.

Today the company employs over 300 people and serves more than 150,000 customers nationwide from offices in Kansas, Nebraska, Iowa, Missouri, and Wisconsin. Its technicians install and integrate smart home systems, including security monitoring, automation, satellite TV (Dish TV), and Starlink internet, while also managing fiber optic projects for residential and commercial clients.

Partnerships with Dish TV and Starlink allow Blue Sky to offer bundled entertainment and connectivity options.

