UPDATE companies SET description='Bluegrass Metal Works, Inc. operates from Louisville, Kentucky. The company was formed by former employees of GCH International, Harpring Inc., and Griffin & Co. who sought to streamline their business model around customer needs and a whatever-it-takes attitude.

The shop provides sheet metal fabrication, structural steel fabrication, custom architectural metalwork, and industrial fabrication. The facility also handles HVAC duct design and installation, dust collection systems, and material handling equipment such as bucket elevators and pneumatic conveyors. Installation services are offered around the clock, often on off-hours shifts.

Customers span food processing, food service, pharmaceutical, industrial manufacturing, and institutional sectors. Examples include utility work centers for restaurants, custom kitchen exhaust hoods and sinks, pharmaceutical equipment, and structural catwalks for industrial plants. The company also serves architectural projects requiring polished stainless steel handrails and custom cabinetry.

