UPDATE companies SET description='Brush Factory was established in 2009 by Hayes Shanesy and Rosie Kovacs in Cincinnati, Ohio. The pair began with a multidisciplinary creative studio, blending Shanesy’s woodworking and mechanical background with Kovacs’s fashion design experience, before focusing on custom wood furniture and case goods. Early experiments included a pop-up design store and small-batch accessory collections.

