UPDATE companies SET description='Byrne Woodworking traces its roots to 1974 when Frank Byrne founded the business in Mountrath, Ireland, drawing on woodworking skills passed down from his grandfather and father. The operation was reestablished in Fairfield, Connecticut, in 1990 and now operates from Bridgeport, Connecticut.

