UPDATE companies SET description='C & M Hydraulics, Inc. was founded in 1994 in North Las Vegas, Nevada. The company began as a specialist in rebuilding Mercedes-Benz hydraulic components, focusing on power steering gearboxes, power steering pumps, air pumps, hydraulic suspension pumps, and ABC pumps.

