UPDATE companies SET description='CA Custom Woodworking Inc. operates from Oswego, Illinois, where it has served the Northern Illinois region for over a decade. The company is family-owned and operated, founded by Chris Ammenhauser, who traces his woodworking roots to childhood hours in a family barn equipped with a table saw and hand tools. At age 23, Ammenhauser placed a newspaper advertisement for custom bookcases and furniture, launching the venture that would grow into a full-time cabinet shop housed in that same renovated barn.

