UPDATE companies SET description='Cables Unlimited operates from Yaphank, New York, where it has been producing custom cable assemblies for over 30 years. The company became a division of RF Industries (Nasdaq: RFIL) following an acquisition in June 2011, expanding its reach into the telecommunications sector.

The company designs and manufactures custom cable assemblies, wire harnesses, fiber optic cables, and hybrid cables. Its in-house capabilities span engineering design assistance, rapid prototyping, and low‑ to high‑volume production. The facility handles everything from simple copper assemblies to complex hybrid cables for cell‑tower and distributed‑antenna systems.

Cables Unlimited serves wireless and telecom carriers upgrading to 5G and LTE, military and aerospace programs requiring mil‑spec and tactical cables, robotics firms needing high‑flex‑life solutions, data‑center and networking customers using Cat 5/6 and fiber, medical device manufacturers, industrial OEMs, and enterprise clients. The company also provides installation services through certified technicians.

The business emphasizes fast turnaround and low minimum orders, backed by a Corning Gold Cable Assembly House designation that enables a 25‑year extended warranty on select fiber products. ITAR registration allows work on defense‑related projects, and the team notes a willingness to work around the clock to meet urgent deadlines.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','UL Recognized','RoHS','Corning Gold Cable Assembly House','IPC/WHMA-A-620','ITAR','BICSI','Molex','Corning','Tyco Electronics','Hubbell']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cable design services", "Rapid in-house prototyping", "Low-volume custom cable manufacturing", "Medium-volume custom cable manufacturing", "High-volume custom cable manufacturing", "Custom wire harness manufacturing", "Fiber optic cable assembly", "Hybrid cable manufacturing", "Installation services by certified technicians", "Engineering assistance", "RoHS compliant constructions", "Corning Gold program qualified assemblies"], "industries": ["Wireless & Telecom", "Enterprise", "Military & Aerospace", "Industrial", "Medical", "Transportation", "Communications", "Automotive", "Robotics", "Computer & Data", "OEMs"], "materials": ["Fiber optic", "Copper"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototype to high volume", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Fast turnaround and low minimum order quantities", "In\u2011house prototyping and engineering design support", "Corning Gold Cable Assembly House with 25\u2011year extended warranty", "ITAR registered for defense and aerospace work"], "facts_used": ["Location: Yaphank, New York -> db", "Acquired by RF Industries in June 2011 -> /about-us", "Over 30 years of experience -> /about-us", "Manufactures custom cable assemblies, wire harnesses, fiber optic cables, hybrid cables -> db", "In-house prototyping, engineering design, low/medium/high volume production -> /", "Serves wireless/telecom, military, aerospace, robotics, computer/data, medical, industrial, OEMs -> /about-us", 