UPDATE companies SET description='Car Parts New Haven operates as a used and pre-owned auto parts store in New Haven, Connecticut, serving the 06519 ZIP code area. The business caters to vehicle owners and mechanics who need replacement components due to accidents or long-term wear, and it ships parts to customers anywhere in the United States and Canada.

