UPDATE companies SET description='Care Medical operates from Gainesville, Georgia, with a staff of over 45 employees across multiple locations in the region. The company was established as a local home medical equipment provider focused on partnering with patients, referral sources, and healthcare professionals to deliver respiratory and mobility solutions.

