UPDATE companies SET description='Carnico Foods LLC operates a USDA-inspected meat processing facility in Litchfield, Michigan. They had previously expanded into Ferry Farms Wholesale, distributing snack sticks, jerky, charcuterie, bacon, ground beef, hot dogs, and beer brats, but repeatedly encountered a shortage of USDA-inspected processing and co-packing capacity. That gap led them to establish Carnico as a locally owned and operated facility to serve farms and wholesale businesses across southern Michigan.

The plant provides processing, secondary packaging, private labeling, co-packing, and product development services. It is equipped with smoking capabilities and a state-of-the-art drying and climatic room for producing specialty sausages and cured meats.

The company focuses on the southern Michigan region, offering USDA-inspected processing that enables farms to bring branded meat products to market.

