UPDATE companies SET description='Carolina Custom Sawing & Lumber operates from Rougemont, North Carolina, in northern Durham County near the Orange and Person county lines. The company was founded in 2017 and has since provided mobile and stationary sawmilling services throughout North Carolina and parts of Virginia, serving the greater Triangle area including Durham, Hillsborough, Chapel Hill, Roxboro, and Raleigh.

The sawmill uses a mobile hydraulic bandsaw capable of processing logs up to 21 feet long and 32 inches in diameter, with a 26-inch throat capacity. It offers both mobile sawmilling (with a five-hour minimum plus travel fees) and stationary milling at its yard (no minimum charge). The company produces and sells its own lumber in green, air-dried, and kiln-dried conditions across more than a dozen species including black walnut, cherry, maple, white oak, red oak, hickory, sycamore, ash, birch, beech, cedar, cypress, southern yellow pine, and elm. Custom orders can yield boards and beams up to 26 inches wide and 21 feet long, with cutting methods such as through-and-through, quartersawn, riftsawn, plainsawn, and livesawn.

Customers range from property owners with downed trees to contractors in residential, commercial, and industrial construction, as well as woodworkers, furniture makers, agricultural operations, and heavy-equipment transport firms needing blocking and cribbing. The company also purchases logs meeting minimum size requirements (12-inch small-end diameter, eight-foot length) for its own inventory.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Mobile sawmilling", "Stationary sawmilling", "Hydraulic bandsaw sawmilling", "Through-and-through sawing", "Quartersawing", "Riftsawing", "Plainsawing", "Livesawing", "Green lumber production", "Air-dried lumber production", "Kiln-dried lumber production", "Custom beam cutting", "Blocking and cribbing production", "Spacer manufacturing", "Trailer decking production", "Post and beam construction lumber", "Mantle production", "Woodworking lumber (tables, benches)", "Log purchasing", "Log yarding and loading"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Industrial construction", "Manufacturing", "Industrial processes", "Woodworking", "Furniture production", "Heavy equipment transportation", "Heavy equipment repair", "Agricultural", "Specialty wood products"], "materials": ["Black Walnut", "Cherry", "Red Maple", "White Oak", "Red Oak", "Hickory", "Sycamore", "Ash", "Birch", "Beech", "Cedar", "Cypress", "Southern Yellow Pine", "Elm"], "equipment": ["Mobile hydraulic bandsaw sawmill"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Mobile hydraulic bandsaw sawmill handling logs up to 21'' long and 32\" diameter", "No minimum charge for stationary milling at their yard", "Custom cutting up to 26\" wide and 21'' long with multiple sawing patterns", "Log purchasing program for qualifying species and sizes"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2017 -> db", "Headquarters Rougemont, North Carolina -> db", "Mobile hydraulic bandsaw sawmill -> /", "Logs up to 21'' long and 32\" diameter -> /about