UPDATE companies SET description='Carolina Farmstead operates from a workshop in Snow Hill, North Carolina, in the eastern part of the state. The business was founded by family patriarch Wayne Noble as a way to employ his sons, Justin and Matt, after a devastating car accident during their college years left Justin a paraplegic and Matt with a traumatic brain injury. Unable to pursue their original career paths, the brothers vowed to work together, combining Justin''s intellect and Matt''s physical strength to build a family-owned furniture company.

The company handcrafts heirloom-quality furniture one piece at a time using solid wood, custom finishes, and customer-specified measurements. Production is organized around three purchasing tiers: in-stock items ready to ship, a line of customizable Farmstead Designs, and fully custom pieces built to a client''s exact vision. Most orders ship within two weeks via an in-house white-glove delivery service.

Its work has been featured on HGTV''s Love It or List It, the PBS series A Chef''s Life, and in Our State Magazine, reflecting a focus on pieces that become centerpieces of family gatherings.

The founding mission — creating meaningful employment for the Noble brothers — remains central to the operation. The company emphasizes construction so robust that grown men can stand and jump on the furniture, backs its quality with Better Business Bureau accreditation, and avoids the shortcuts common in mass-market retail.', certifications=ARRAY['Better Business Bureau Accreditation']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Handcrafted furniture manufacturing", "Custom wood finishing", "Custom measurements", "White-glove delivery", "In-stock furniture", "Customizable design tiers", "Fully custom furniture design"], "industries": ["Residential furniture", "Home furnishings"], "materials": ["Solid wood"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Most orders ship within 2 weeks", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Handcrafted from solid wood with custom finishes and measurements", "White-glove delivery service with most orders shipping within 2 weeks", "Better Business Bureau accredited for trust and integrity", "Furniture built to withstand heavy use (e.g., grown men can stand and jump on them)", "Three purchasing options: in-stock, customizable designs, fully custom"], "facts_used": ["Founded by Wayne Noble for his sons after car accident -> db", "Located in Snow Hill, North Carolina -> db", "Handcrafted furniture from solid wood with custom finishes and measurements -> /", "White-glove delivery service, most orders ship within 2 weeks -> db", "BBB Accredited -> /quality", "Featured on HGTV''s Love It or List It, PBS A Chef''s Life, Our State Magazine -> /", "Lead craftsman Matt Noble -> /quality", "Three purchasing options: In Stock, Farmstead Designs, Fully Customized -> /", "Family-owned, crafted by generations of family -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Every Carolina Farmstead piece is handcrafted to bring warmth, character, and permanence into your home.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": ""