UPDATE companies SET description='Checkered Racing operates from Spencer, Indiana, where it fabricates and sells custom chassis components for street rods and race cars.

The shop builds back halves and front ends to any width, offering them in any stage of completion with customer‑specified options. Its catalog also includes rolling chassis, disc‑brake conversion kits, and a range of suspension components. In addition to its own fabricated line, Checkered Racing stocks products from brands such as QA1 Precision Products, RideTech, and Vi‑King Performance.

Customers include individual builders and racers working on projects from classic Novas to C10 trucks. Testimonials cite a full chassis for an ’85 C10, a tube front end for a ’72 Nova, and a ground‑up frame‑to‑interior build.

